  "[action] Wang Lung enjoys the earth's smell.",
  "[action] Elder son takes wife's hand",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"Well, and it is not for the sake of the land that I wish to go back to the earth. It is for the sake of my peace and quiet and my ease. I have had enough of men and women and noise and strife and it is not worth while to be troubled with anything when one has silver and a good house and a wife who waits on one.\"",
